msgid ""
"**Description**: List curated single-cell RNA-seq collections from CZI "
"CellxGene Discovery. Each collection is a published dataset group with "
"DOI, typically corresponding to a paper. The platform hosts 350+ public "
"collections spanning diverse tissues, diseases, and organisms with cell-"
"type annotations. Returns collection name, DOI, dataset count, total cell"
" count, and curator info."
msgstr ""

